family: F1
grade: deterministic

--- prompt ---
For the tt_content field tx_benchfixture_level, Page TSconfig modifies the select
items available in the backend form.

Which item value is removed, and which alternative labels are configured? Answer for
page 2.

--- oracle ---
grep -A5 'TCEFORM.tt_content.tx_benchfixture_level' packages/bench_fixture/Configuration/page.tsconfig

--- check ---
grep -qE '(^|[^0-9])20([^0-9]|$)' "$RESPONSE_FILE" || exit 1
grep -qiF 'Muted (fixture override)' "$RESPONSE_FILE" || exit 1
grep -qiF 'Hero (fixture override)' "$RESPONSE_FILE"
